<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thessalonicate</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thessalonicate</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thessalonicate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silas le Timothy kung pan — Pa Pathian le Topa Jesus Christ ii neisa ahi Thessalonica pawlpi mite tungah: Thuthiamna le kilemna sia no aa hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note theampo atu in Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko tawntung a, tuaciang thungetna sungah na min kong lo tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Upna na zakzia uh, itna na nei uh hu a, nasia takin na nasepna zia le ih Topa Jesus Christ sungah na lametna uh a kipzia sia ih Pa Pathian mai ah kong phawk uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko ii suapuite awng, Pathian in note hong it a, ama atu in hong tealsa na hi uh sia ka he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Lungdamna Thupha sia, kammal nguak taw hi ngawlin, vaangletna le Thaa Thiangtho taw zongh le a thumaan thutak saan tatakna taw no kungah kong puak uh hi. Note taw ka om uh lai in bangbangin nungta khu ziam ci in nong he uh hi; tuate in noma ii phat natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Koma le Topa ettee in nong zui uh hi; nasia takin thuak na hi ta uh zong, Thaa Thiangtho kung pan hong pai tua thu sia lungdamna taw na saang zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom note sia Macedonia le Achaia ah thu umte theampo atu in ettee tu khat na suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangbang ziam cile Topa thu in no tung pan Macedonia le Achaia kaantan in pai a, tua bek dom ngawlin, Pathian na upna uh thu sia mun theampo ah thang hi. Tua ahikom thudang bangma ka son tuan tu kisamh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua mihing theampo in kong haw uh lai a, nong saan zia uh, milim biakna pan Pathian sangah na kikhealna uhte son tek a, a maan le a nungta Pathian atu sepsak tu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hong tung tu Pathian thin uukna pan hong suatak, ama ii thina pan a thawsak, vantung pan hong pai tu — ama Tapa Jesus ngak tu in na om uh thute son hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ko ii suapuite awng, no kung kong hawna uh sia, nguaksuak ngawl hi ci in noma mama ii na heak uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noma kung Thessalonica ah kong pai uh ma in Philippi ah kote hong kivawtsia zo a, hong kizawnsakzia sia na heak uh ahi hi. Tuaciangin hong langpan tam kale, ama kung pan a hong pai Lungdamna Thupha note tungah kong son natu in, ih Pathian in thinletna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note tungah kong maangkaana uh sia khialna ahibuale a thiangtho ngawl niimnate tungah kibulphu ngawl hi, khat po theam tu zongh ka hanciam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate luangin Pathian in pau a hong dei bangin ka pau tawntung uh hi, banghang ziam cile Lungdamna Thupha son tu in kote kiphu hi ci in ama in khensat hi. Mihingte diksak tu in ka hanciam bua uh hi, ahihang ka niimna uh hong sittel Pathian diksak tu in ka hanciam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note kungah kong pai uh lai in, kisialpokna kampauna taw kong pai bua uh a, duhopna a phualseal natu kammalte kong zangh bua uh hi. Tuabang ka hi uh sia noma in nong he mama uh hi — Pathian sia koma tetti ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No tung pan hikale, ngualdangte tung pan hikale, kuama tung pan pokna nga tu in ka hanciam bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Christ ii sawltakte ka hina uh taw, ka deina uhte no tung pan kong nget thei uh hi napi, kong ngen bua uh hi. Ahihang note taw ka om uh lai in nu khat ii tate a kep bangin kong khoi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No kong it hu in Pathian kung pan hong pai Lungdamna Thupha bek hi ngawlin ka nuntakna uh no hong hawm tu in ka kinging uh hi. Note sia ko atu in a ithuai mama na hi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko ii suapuite awng, ka sep ka dianna uh teng ciamtee nak vak uh te! Pathian tung pan hong pai Lungdamna Thupha no tungah kong hil uh ciangin, no ngim kong piakna uh ahi ngawl natu in, a sun a zanin na ka seam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No thu umte tungah ka ngamtatna uh sia thiangtho, maan, khialna om ngawl ahi hunlam note in ka tetti te na hi uh a, Pathian zongh ka tetti uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pa ii tate tung, a vawt tu bangin note khat sim tungah kong vawt uh sia na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama Ngam le a minthanna hong hawm tu in hong sam Pathian ii diksak nuntakna a nei tu in, kong hanthawn a, kong heeneam a, kong thawn top uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciangin, Pathian tungah a tawntung lungdam ka kona uh ahang khat zongh om hi. Pathian thu kong puak uh lai in, mihing ii thupuak bang hi ngawlin Pathian thupuak bang ahi takpi sia na za uh a, na saang uh hi. Banghang ziam cile no thu umte sungah Pathian in na hong seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ko ii suapuite awng, no sungah thupiangte ma Judea ah Pathian ii Pawlpite, tua mun a om Christ Jesus ii neisa mihingte tung zongh ah piang hi. Note in na mipuite ii vawtsiatna na thuak uh bangin, amate zongh Jew te ii vawtsiatna thuak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua Jew te in Topa Jesus le kamsaangte thatlum a, ko hong vawtsiate ma ahi uh hi. Amate Pathian atu in bangza in lungkimhuai ngawl tu ziam! A kuama po atu in amate bangza in ngal ciipha ahi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngupna a piangsak tu thute Gentile te tungah ka hil tu uh ngawngawn khaktan tu in hanciam uh hi. Hi bangin amate ii a paltan tawntung sa mawna theampo pawlcingsak uh hi. Tu in Pathian thin uukna sia amate tungah a khakbel ciangin hong thengsuk zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ko ka hi uh le suapuite awng, note taw tawmvei ih kikhen zawkciang — ka ngaisutna uh taw hi ngawlin, pumpi mama taw — bangza in no hong ngai a, kong mu kik natu bangza haksa in hanciam khu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note kungah kong heak kik nuam uh hi. Keima mama heak kik tu in khatvei bek dom ngawl ka kithoai bul a, ahihang Satan in hong oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A huamin ci leang, note sia — ngualdang hi ngawl! — note sia kote lametna, lungdamna le zawna ka nga uh hu in Topa Jesus hong pai ciang, ama mai ah ka kisuantaakna na hi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note sia kote kiphatsakna le lungdamna tatak na hi tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A khakbel ciang ka thuak zo nawn bua uh hi. Tua ahikom Athens ah koma nguakin, om tu in ka khensat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua lanin, Christ huvau Lungdamna Thupha hil a, Pathian atu ko taw naseam khawm ko ii suapui Timothy kong paisak uh hi. Hong thakhosak tu le, na upna uh sungah hong hu tu in kong paisak uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hi vawtsiatna hu in, kuama na nungtol kik ngawl natu ka deina uh ahi hi. Tuabang vawtsiatna in Pathian ii ei atu a deina thu khat om hi ci in, noma ma in na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile noma taw ka om nginge laitakin, ko hong kivawtsiat natu te kong sonkhol zo uh hi; tuaciang na heaksa uh bangma in, tuabang tatak ma in hong piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia hu in Timothy kong paisak kul hi. Vei zo nawn ngawl ka hikomin na upna uh dawp tu in ama kong paisak hi. Doaimangpa in no hong ze et zo a, ko nasep teng a luithawthong hi zo ci sia suak thei mama ngawl tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu in Timothy hong heak kik zo a, tuaciangin ama na upna uh le, na itna uh taw kisai ka ngalaak uh thu, hong puak hi. Ama in kote tung hong sonna pan, a pha in nong ngaisut tawntung na uh le, ko ii kong mu nop uh bangma no zongh in nong mu nopna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka ngimna uh le ka thuakna theampo sungah, note ii thu in thin letna hong pia hi, suapuite awng. Ko hong thinliansak sia in noma upna ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tu in na nuntakna sungah Topa taw pum khat a, a kho in na ding uh le a nungta takpite ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in note atu in Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko thei zo uh hi. Note hangin ama mai ah lungnopna ka nei uh hu in Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maitang kisi a, kimu thei natu le na upna uh sungah a kisamh sia hong piak thei natu a sun a zanin, ka thin theampo taw thu ka ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ih Pa Pathian mama le ih Topa Jesus in no kungah kong pai thei natu in lampi hong sialsak tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khat le khat na ki itna uh le mihing theampo na itna sungah khangto vaialin, noma kong itna a lian za ma in na ki it natu uh, Topa in hong siam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi bangin ama in no hong thahatsak tu a, ama ii neisa mihing theampo taw Topa Jesus hong pai ciang, ih Pa Pathian omna ah sit baang ngawlin na thiangtho tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A khakbelin suapuite awng, Pathian ii diksak nuntakzia sia, ko tung panin na sin sa uh ahi hi. Hisia in note nuntakzia sia ma ahi hi. Tu in tua sang zong a nasia zaw in na nuntak natu uh Topa Jesus min taw kong ngen uh a, kong thawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa Jesus thuneina taw hilna kong piakte na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in note thiangtho in, numei le pa paktatna pan a thiangtho tak a, a kipealte na hi tu uh hong dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No pasalte khat sim in, na zi uh taw a thiangtho le a thasiahuai in nuntakzia tu na heak uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian a he ngawlte bangin cii le sa deina taw na nungta heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi thu tungtaang ah, kuama in ama ii Tapidawpuipa tungah khial ngawl tu a, hamphatna in la thei ngawl tu hi. Hi thu kong son ngei zo uh a, tuabang a ngamtate Topa in daan pia tu hi, ci in nasia takin kidop natu kong son zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in eite sia paktatna taw nungta ngawlin a thiangtho nuntakna taw a nungta zaw tu in hong sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom, hi kihilna a nial pawpo sia mihing nial ahi bua a, a Thaa Thiangtho no tungah hong pia Pathian nial ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noma thu up puite itna tu huvau lai at tu kul ka sa bua uh hi. Khat le khat na ki it natu in Pathian in no tung mama ah hong hil zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciang a tatak ci leang Macedonia ngam mun theampo ah a om, suapui teng tungah tuabangin na ngamta zo uh hi. Tua ahikom suapuite awng, tu a sangin zongh a kician zaw lai in na ngamta tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kong son ngeisa bangma in, na nuntakna sungah nuam hithiatin na nuntak tu, noma taw kisaite bek ngaisutin nei tu, noma nuntak natu in na thalaw natu uh teng sia tup in na nei vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi bang teng taw in thu um ngawlte ii zatakna na nga tu uh a, tuaciang na kitaangsapna tungtaang ah kuama na konlaw uh a kul buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ko ii suapuite awng, lametna a nei ngawlte bangin na khuangai ngawl natu in, a thisate huvau thumaan thutak na heak tu uh ka dei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesus thi a, tho kik hi, ci in ih um hi, tua ahikom ama um a, a thite sia Pathian in Jesus taw hong la kik tu hi, ci in ih um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu a kong hil uh sia in Topa ii hilcianna ahi hi: Topa hong pai ni in, ei a nungta laite in a thisate mai ah ih pai buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vantunglalangte sung pan a lianbel sia ii aw taw thupiak auna, Pathian lemle aw om tu a, tuaciang Topa ama mama vantung pan hong tuaksuk tu hi. Christ um a, a thite hong tho masabel tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tua hunin a nungta lai eite sia Topa taw vui sungah kisi tu in, amate taw meei sungah hong kikaikhawm tu hi. Tuabangin eite in a tawntungin Topa taw ih omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom, hi kammalte taw khat le khat na kihanthawn tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suapuite awng, hi thute hong pianna tu a hun a taang huvau, lai kong at tu uh kul sa ngawl khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile noma ma in Topa Ni sia, zan lai a, nguta khat hong pai bang in, hong pai tu hi, ci in a pha tak na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte in, “Na theampo thim khipkhep hi, lungmuanna om hi,” a ci laitakin thakhat thu in, siatna sia amate tungah hong theng vat tu hi! Nau a suak tu numei khat sia nautun a, a nat bangin thakhatin hong pai tu hi, tuaciang mihingte a suakta buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang suapuite awng, note in khuazing sungah om ngawl nu hi, tua ahikom tua Ni in nguta khat hong pai a, lamdang na sak bang ahi buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note theampo in khuavak ii neisa, sun hun ii neisa na hi uh hi. Eite sia zan ii neisa, khuazing sungah a omte ih hi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngualdangte bangin ih mutthip buatu hi; eite khangciimin ih pilvang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zan sia mihingte mut hun hi; zanin amate zukham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang eite in sun hun ii neisa ih hi a, ih pilvang kul tu hi. Eite in upna le ki itna sia awmdalna in ih silh tu a, ih lamet ngupna sia thik lukhu bangin ih khuk kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in eite sia a thin uukna thuak tu in hong teal bua a, Topa Jesus Christ tungtawnin, ngupna a nga tu in hong teal hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama hong pai ciang, ih thi a ih nung zong, ama taw ih nuntak khop thei natu in eite atu a thi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tu laitak a, na sep uh bangma in khat le khat kihanthawnin na kihuu tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suapuite awng, Tapidaw nuntakna sungah lam hong lak, hong hil a, no sungah na hong seamte tungah ahi tu bang zatakna na piak natu in kong ngen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate ii sepna hu in itna le zatakna lianbel taw na kizom tavun. Noma sungah kilemna taw na om tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Suapuite awng, hi bangin kong hanthawn uh hi. A zuzaute kidop natu thu na pia vun a, a lauthauhte na hansua vun, a thazawmte na hu vun, a kuama theampo tungah thinsau in na khual vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khialna sia khialna taw in na thuk heak vun a, khat le khat tung le mihing theampo tungah phatna vawt tu sia hun theampo sungah na tup na sawm uh na hisak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tawntungin lungdam vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />hun theampo sungah thu ngen tawntung vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />na theampo sungah lungdamko vun. Christ Jesus taw pumkhat a, na nuntak sungah Pathian hong deisak thu in hisia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thaa Thiangtho na khaam heak vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian tung pan hi a kici kamsaannate sia zawngsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na theampo na sittel vun: a pha teng na keam tavun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sia nam theampo na pial tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eite thinnopna hong pia Pathian in note a nanam in hong thiangthosak tahen, na nuntakna buppi - na thaa, na thinsung le na pumpi — hong keam tahen, Topa Jesus Christ hong pai ciangin sepkhial vawtkhial theampo taw hong kipealsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hong sampa ama in na hong seam tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Suapuite awng, ko atu zongh thu hong ngetsak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thu um theampo suapui kinapna taw na kimuak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thu um mi theampo tungah hi laithak na sim natu in Topa thuneina suangin kong thawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ih Topa Jesus Christ ii thuthiamna no tungah hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
